        70.86609649658203,
        66.76272583007812,
        220.46530151367188,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.6021728515625,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation places high value on saving lives. Given both the high certainty of evidence for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992146492004395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.4345703125,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "this benefit and the fact that the potential harm of acquired DR-TB can be mitigated by supervision",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4268188476562,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "of treatment. Periodic drug resistance surveys (or ongoing surveillance) in each country are essential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        438.9964904785156,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "for monitoring the impact of the regimen and the overall treatment programme.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.2158966064453,
        229.04690551757812,
        178.0959014892578
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1.2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        189.80120849609375,
        203.97349548339844,
        204.1562042236328
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        211.41583251953125,
        466.99017333984375,
        225.7708282470703
      ],
      "text": "1.2 Wherever feasible, the optimal dosing frequency for new patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        223.41583251953125,
        393.4870300292969,
        237.7708282470703
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB is daily throughout the course of therapy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.48127746582031,
        239.6678466796875,
        378.925537109375,
        254.02284240722656
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.8982238769531,
        220.7113037109375,
        286.7502136230469
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.9581298828125,
        527.547119140625,
        308.4011535644531
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and considered valid in the 2017 guidelines update",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957568168640137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.048095703125,
        527.438720703125,
        321.6011047363281
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 (see summary of recommendations in  ). The recommendation is copied without modification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.973067283630371,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.35809326171875,
        434.7330627441406,
        334.8011169433594
      ],
      "text": "into this consolidated document and appears exactly as in the 2010 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.1754150390625,
        216.29168701171875,
        364.02740478515625
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.2353210449219,
        527.516357421875,
        385.6783447265625
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis included 21 472 participants in 312 arms of 57 RCTs conducted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971161842346191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.1593017578125,
        527.41650390625,
        398.8783264160156
      ],
      "text": "(7) in various regions of the world since 1965  . In a multivariate regression analysis, each arm of the 57",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.993297576904297,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.63531494140625,
        527.4379272460938,
        412.0783386230469
      ],
      "text": "RCTs was treated as a separate cohort, and results were adjusted for potentially confounding patient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.8352966308594,
        527.446533203125,
        425.2783203125
      ],
      "text": "and treatment factors. Only one study of 223 patients evaluated a rifampicin-containing regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.0353088378906,
        512.4953002929688,
        438.47833251953125
      ],
      "text": "administered twice weekly throughout therapy; this study was not included in the meta-analyses.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.73931884765625,
        527.4420166015625,
        460.1823425292969
      ],
      "text": "No significant increase in failure, relapse or acquired drug resistance was found when daily dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.939208984375,
        527.5394897460938,
        473.3822326660156
      ],
      "text": "throughout therapy was compared with the following intermittent regimens in new TB patients overall,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965646743774414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.1391906738281,
        498.38665771484375,
        486.58221435546875
      ],
      "text": "namely: daily then thrice weekly; daily then twice weekly; or thrice weekly throughout therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.84320068359375,
        527.4913940429688,
        508.2862243652344
      ],
      "text": "However, the regression analysis showed that patients being treated thrice weekly throughout therapy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972765922546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.043212890625,
        527.4518432617188,
        521.4862060546875
      ],
      "text": "had rates of acquired drug resistance that were 3.3 times higher than those in patients who received",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.2431640625,
        293.1947937011719,
        534.6861572265625
      ],
      "text": "daily drug administration throughout treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.9471435546875,
        524.562255859375,
        556.39013671875
      ],
      "text": "The meta-analysis revealed no difference in rates of failure, relapse or acquired drug resistance in pan-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.1470947265625,
        527.5712890625,
        569.590087890625
      ],
      "text": "susceptible new patients being treated with these dosing schedules. However, the use of a three times",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97892951965332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.3471069335938,
        527.399169921875,
        582.7901000976562
      ],
      "text": "weekly intensive phase schedule in patients with pre-treatment isoniazid resistance was associated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.2711181640625,
        516.0419921875,
        595.9901123046875
      ],
      "text": "(9) in another meta-analysis with a significantly higher risk of failure and acquired drug resistance  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.3643188476562,
        245.23455810546875,
        625.2163696289062
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.42431640625,
        527.2020263671875,
        646.8673095703125
      ],
      "text": "When based in a health facility, daily administration of therapy places a larger burden on TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.6243286132812,
        527.5023803710938,
        660.0673217773438
      ],
      "text": "programmes and patients than does intermittent therapy. Intermittent regimens require stronger",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.8243408203125,
        527.3916625976562,
        673.267333984375
      ],
      "text": "programmes with higher-quality patient supervision, but all regimens should be provided with full",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.0242919921875,
        222.6969451904297,
        686.46728515625
      ],
      "text": "patient supervision and support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.7282104492188,
        527.4178466796875,
        708.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "Studies of patients’ preferences for dosing schedules were not systematically reviewed. The higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.92822265625,
        527.3936157226562,
        721.3712158203125
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid dose used in intermittent therapy was not considered to have an increased incidence of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.128173828125,
        471.924072265625,
        734.5711669921875
      ],
      "text": "adverse effects. The rifampicin dosage was unchanged when using intermittent therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.8320922851562,
        527.5963745117188,
        756.2750854492188
      ],
      "text": "In an international, multicentre, randomized trial (Union Study A), Jindani, Nunn & Enarson found thrice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949986457824707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.7562255859375,
        527.4150390625,
        769.4752197265625
      ],
      "text": "(10) weekly dosing resulted in significantly lower culture conversion rates at 2 months  . In developing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320.85479736328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        551.980712890625,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 1 Drug-susceptible TB treatment: Recommendations 9",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}